<p>The environment, decor, ambient temperature, and furnishings become altered to be more attractive to a pre-pubescent human female. Tables will be set with a pink tea set with a teapot filled with a sweet red liquid, various sweet treats will manifest, and the table cover will become a lace tablecloth of a style popular during the mid-19th Century.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>The first part is just way too over-reaching (and highly subjective) a statement. For example, I can't imagine that a young girl growing up in the poorest parts of Ethiopia, one living the high-life on 5th Avenue, and one from uh, darkest Peru would have that same ideal atheistic. I would kill the first sentence and just start it with &quot;Tables will be set&#8230;&quot;</p>

							</div>

								
